OL,3,GNEWSAWho is new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,AMichael Marra?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Marra has been elected as the
OL,7,Fnew leader of Scottish Labour,
OL,8,Fsucceeding Anas Sarwar.
OL,10,FThe North East MSP took up his seat at
OL,11,FHolyrood just five years ago.
OL,13,FA history buff with a reputation for
OL,14,Fbeing a tough scrutiniser, Marra comes
OL,15,Ffrom a trade unionist family with
OL,16,Fstrong Labour ties.
OL,18,FHere's all you need to know about the
OL,19,FMSP.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
